@startuml
' AWS serverless web architecture (C4 level 2). Demonstrates the AWS vendor
' icon set: CloudFront edge -> API Gateway -> Lambda compute -> DynamoDB +
' RDS data tier, with S3 for static assets and SNS/SQS for async fan-out.
'
' Source: https://github.com/hanv89/archicon
' License: MIT (this diagram); see repo LICENSE.
' Icons:
'   AWS Architecture Icons via awslabs/aws-icons-for-plantuml, licensed
'     CC-BY-ND 2.0 (Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives). The icons are
'     redistributed VERBATIM (byte-identical to upstream) — they are NOT
'     resized, recolored, cropped, or re-encoded, because the NoDerivatives
'     clause forbids derivative works (a resize IS a derivative). See repo
'     NOTICE + dist/AWS/USAGE-RULES.txt. "AWS Architecture Icons" (c) Amazon
'     Web Services, Inc. or its affiliates; this project is not affiliated
'     with, sponsored by, or endorsed by AWS.
'
' Filenames are copied verbatim from dist/AWS/INDEX.md (e.g. S3 is
' `SimpleStorageService.png`, NOT `S3.png`) — guessing a name is a 404.
'
' Render: paste this file's content into
'   https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/uml/
' The PlantUML server fetches each <img:URL> at render time from this
' repository's public raw URLs.

left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho

title AWS serverless web architecture

actor "User" as user

' ----- Edge -----
rectangle "**CloudFront**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/NetworkingContentDelivery/CloudFront.png>\nCDN + edge cache" as cf

rectangle "**API Gateway**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/NetworkingContentDelivery/APIGateway.png>\nREST entry" as apigw

' ----- Compute -----
rectangle "**Lambda**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/Compute/Lambda.png>\norder handler" as fn

' ----- Async fan-out -----
rectangle "**SNS**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/ApplicationIntegration/SimpleNotificationService.png>\nevent topic" as sns
rectangle "**SQS**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/ApplicationIntegration/SimpleQueueService.png>\nwork queue" as sqs

' ----- Data tier -----
rectangle "**S3**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/Storage/SimpleStorageService.png>\nstatic assets" as s3
rectangle "**DynamoDB**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/Database/DynamoDB.png>\nsession + cart" as ddb
rectangle "**RDS**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/AWS/Database/RDS.png>\nproduct catalog" as rds

' ----- Flow -----
user -right-> cf : HTTPS
cf -right-> s3 : static GET
cf -right-> apigw : API GET/POST
apigw -right-> fn : invoke
fn -right-> ddb : read/write
fn -right-> rds : T-SQL
fn -down-> sns : publish OrderPlaced
sns -down-> sqs : fan-out
@enduml
